# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository and on checkout, so the
# Windows/WSL editor writing CRLF no longer shows whole files as "modified".
* text=auto eol=lf

# Large data files are left exactly as committed (avoid churning them here).
*.csv -text

# Explicit binaries (never touch their bytes).
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.gz   binary
*.zip  binary
*.pdf  binary
